            -113.531127,53.61698,0
            -113.539216,53.616982,0
            -113.54019,53.616979,0
          </coordinates>
        </LineString>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Phase 3 - Castle Downs to Campbell Road</name>
        <description><![CDATA[The LRT will continue west until it reaches the at-grade 137 Street Station. This station will service the neighbourhoods of Oxford and Carlton to the north, and Cumberland to the south.<br><br>What We Heard: <br>https://www.edmonton.ca/documents/RoadsTraffic/MetroLineNWWhatWeHeardReportFall2017.pdf]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#line-9C27B0-4000</styleUrl>
