      <Placemark>
        <name>Phase 3 - Castle Downs to Campbell Road</name>
        <description><![CDATA[The LRT will continue west until it reaches the at-grade137 Street Station. This station will service the neighbourhoods of Oxford and Carlton to the north, and Cumberland to the south. <br><br>Edmontonians in communities Northwest of City Centre share their vision of the Metro Line Northwest LRT Extension.<br><br>What We Heard: <br>https://www.edmonton.ca/documents/RoadsTraffic/MetroLineNWWhatWeHeardReportFall2017.pdf]]></description>
