      <Placemark>
        <name>Phase 3 - Castle Downs to Campbell Road</name>
        <description><![CDATA[The LRT will continue west with an underpass below the existing CN rail tracks and return to street level at the 142 Street intersection, continuing west along the south side of 153 Avenue towards the Campbell Road Station.<br><br>Edmontonians in communities Northwest of City Centre share their vision of the Metro Line Northwest LRT Extension.<br><br>What We Heard: <br>https://www.edmonton.ca/documents/RoadsTraffic/MetroLineNWWhatWeHeardReportFall2017.pdf]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#line-9C27B0-4000</styleUrl>
