      <Placemark>
        <name>Phase 1 - NAIT/Blatchford Market to Blatchford Gate </name>
        <description><![CDATA[After leaving NAIT/Blatchford Market Station, the train will travel to Blatchford Gate Station. <br><br>Edmontonians in communities Northwest of City Centre share their vision of the Metro Line Northwest LRT Extension.<br><br>What We Heard:<br>https://www.edmonton.ca/documents/RoadsTraffic/MetroLineNWWhatWeHeardReportFall2017.pdf ]]></description>
