      <Placemark>
        <name>NAIT/ Blatchford Market Station</name>
        <description>The NAIT/Blatchford Market station will accommodate up to 5-car trains on Metro Line, as ridership demand warrants, providing additional transit capacity to better serve students and residents travelling to and from the area.</description>
