      <Placemark>
        <name>Design Phase - 137 Avenue Station </name>
        <description>The 137 Avenue Station will be a trenched station where the LRT travels just below ground through an underpass. A trenched station will help mitigate east-west traffic impacts on 137 Avenue and allow pedestrians to access the station without having to cross the intersection.</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1499-000000</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>
            -113.516546,53.60132,0
