      <Placemark>
        <name>Design Phase - 145 Avenue Station </name>
        <description>The station is a split-platform configuration where the platforms are located on opposite sides of the intersection. This station will service the Griesbach development, as well as the mature neighbourhoods of Carlisle and Caernarvon to the west.</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1499-000000</styleUrl>
