      <Placemark>
        <name>Design Phase - Castle Downs Station</name>
        <description>The LRT will continue north along Castle Downs Road and then turn west at 153 Avenue into Castle Downs Station. The station will be integrated with the transit center, and will provide service to the nearby YMCA, schools, district park, and mature neighbourhoods.</description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1499-000000</styleUrl>
