      <Placemark>
        <name>Design Phase - Campbell Road Station</name>
        <description><![CDATA[The Metro Line Northwest LRT will end at the Nakî Transit Centre and Park & Ride, run by the City of St.Albert. It is located at Campbell Road and 153 Avenue. The LRT stop will be integrated with the Park & Ride facility to allow transfers between Edmonton and St. Albert.]]></description>
